# --- Questions the board raises (not answered here) ---
:Q_BlueStickyMeaning a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "What does a blue sticky mean, versus yellow?" ;
    rdfs:comment "8 leaves are blue and set in italics (Voice control, Smart kitchen, Larder tracker, Historical recipes, Aller-genes, Fridge-photo recipe generation, Food pairing, Dinner-party planner). The board has no legend. Candidates: innovative / later / out-of-scope / tech-dependent." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Brainstorm_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "whole board" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_Brainstorm_2026_10 dkg:raises :Q_BlueStickyMeaning .

:Q_FoodPairingHome a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Does Food pairing belong to Planner, Recipe Search, or both?" ;
    rdfs:comment "A line from Planner ends at Food pairing; a line from Recipe Search also reaches it (and may run on behind it to Fridge-photo recipe generation). Recorded in both clusters." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Brainstorm_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "Planner / Recipe Search, lower right" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Idea_FoodPairing dkg:raises :Q_FoodPairingHome .

:Q_LarderTwoSenses a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "'Larder' — the product, or the pantry?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Centre sticky 'Larder' reads as the product name; 'Larder tracker' (Shopping) uses larder as the household pantry. One word, two concepts candidate." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Brainstorm_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "centre; Shopping branch" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Idea_LarderTracker dkg:raises :Q_LarderTwoSenses .
:Cluster_Larder dkg:raises :Q_LarderTwoSenses .

