:As_MealChooser_Class_v3 a dkg:Assertion ;
    rdf:subject :Cap_MealChooser ; rdf:predicate rdfs:comment ; rdf:object "supporting" ;
    dkg:supersedes :As_MealChooser_Class ;
    rdfs:comment "was core on capability maps v1 and v2" ;
    dkg:source :Art_CapabilityMap_2026_10_v3 ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .

# --- Proposed merges arising from the renames (cross-artifact) ---
:Cap_AIProposals dkg:proposedSameAs :Idea_SearchWithThingsIAlreadyHave ;
    rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Idea_SearchWithThingsIAlreadyHave: 'Proposals based on larder' vs brainstorm Recipe Search sticky (cross-class)" .
:Cap_AIProposals dkg:proposedSameAs :Idea_LarderTracker ;
    rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Idea_LarderTracker: the capability now depends on knowing the larder; brainstorm blue sticky under Shopping (cross-class, weak — may be a dependency, not identity)" .

# --- Effect on open questions (recorded, none closed) ---
:Q_LarderTwoSenses rdfs:comment "Capability map v3 'Proposals based on larder, etc.' uses larder in the pantry sense, inside a product the impact map calls 'Larder - recipe sharing platform'. Both senses are now live in current artifacts." .
:Q_CookingSupportStatus rdfs:comment "Capability map v3 renames the generic level-2 'Cooking support' to 'Cooking aids'; the level-1 group stays 'Cooking Support'." .
:Q_CapabilityMarks dkg:source :Art_CapabilityMap_2026_10_v3 ;
    rdfs:comment "On capability map v3 the mark above Member management points up (▲); the one above Planner still points right (▸)." .

