# ---------------- Questions raised by the stories and the glossary ----------------
:Q_HelpRequestAtWhom a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Is a Help Request at a Community, at a Grandma Avatar, or at both?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Glossary draws 'at 1 Community' and 'at 1 Grandma Avatar' as two separate mandatory ends. Story B asks only the Community, stories C and E only Grandma Avatar, story A a Chef the glossary does not know." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Glossary_2026_10, :Art_Story_A, :Art_Story_B, :Art_Story_C, :Art_Story_E ; dkg:locator "glossary arrows 'at'; sentence 3 of each story" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Rel_HelpRequestAtCommunity dkg:raises :Q_HelpRequestAtWhom .
:Rel_HelpRequestAtGrandmaAvatar dkg:raises :Q_HelpRequestAtWhom .
:Q_ChefNotInGlossary a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Where do Chef, Dinner and Meal Planning help live in the glossary?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Story A: a Chef helps plan a Dinner. The glossary's three Help Request kinds are catastrophe, preparation step and ingredients — no planning help, no Chef." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Story_A, :Art_Glossary_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "story A sentences 2-4" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_Story_A dkg:raises :Q_ChefNotInGlossary .
:Q_PicturesTwoSenses a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Are 'Pictures' of the burnt meal and 'Pictures' of the finished meal one concept?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Story E: evidence sent with the help request (2b, 3) vs trophy shared with the Community (5b, 6b). Glossary keeps one 'Picture' contained by Help Request, Help and Thanks. Not split here: the story does not qualify either use." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Story_E, :Art_Glossary_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "story E 2b, 3, 5b, 6b" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_Story_E dkg:raises :Q_PicturesTwoSenses .
:Q_WhoSharesPictures a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Who shares the Pictures with the Community — the Cook or the helper?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Sentence 6 in stories A, B, C, E: the 'and shares' arrow leaves the helper's icon (Chef, Community, Grandma Avatar). Read here as the Cook's continued sentence." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Story_A, :Art_Story_B, :Art_Story_C, :Art_Story_E ; dkg:locator "sentence 6b of each" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_Story_A dkg:raises :Q_WhoSharesPictures .
:Q_StoryDNumbering a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Story D numbers 3 and 4 twice — parallel, or a numbering slip?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Also 'wnat' and 'findes' kept verbatim." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Story_D ; dkg:locator "sentences 3, 3, 4, 4" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_Story_D dkg:raises :Q_StoryDNumbering .
:Q_CompetitionOutsideGlossary a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Does the competition story belong to the same glossary?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Story D's Competition, Community Administrator, Other cooks, Winner, Rating, Highest rate have no glossary term; the glossary covers help-and-thanks only." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Story_D, :Art_Glossary_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "story D" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_Story_D dkg:raises :Q_CompetitionOutsideGlossary .
:Q_LarderTwoSenses rdfs:comment "No domain story and no glossary term uses 'Larder' or a pantry." .

