    rdfs:comment "No legend. Blue+⊞: Dinner, Menu, Course. Green+⊞: Help provider, Chef, Help Meal plan, Menu proposal. Meal now pale grey. 10 terms added, none removed; 5 cardinalities changed; 'Ingredient Substitute belongs to' now points at empty space. Help provider introduced as a supertype of Community, Grandma Avatar and Chef. No Decision in the graph asked for this revision." ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-10-10"^^xsd:date .

