:Con_Substitute rdfs:comment "glossary v2 draws 'Substitute is Ingredient' as a plain arrow with cardinality 1, not an is-a" .
:Con_Community rdfs:subClassOf :Con_HelpProvider .
:Con_GrandmaAvatar rdfs:subClassOf :Con_HelpProvider .
:Con_Chef rdfs:subClassOf :Con_HelpProvider .
:Con_HelpMealPlan rdfs:subClassOf :Con_HelpRequest .

# --- Proposed merges for the additions (cross-artifact) ---
:Con_Chef dkg:proposedSameAs :Act_Chef ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Act_Chef: glossary term vs story/board actor (cross-class)" .
:Con_Ingredient dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_Ingredients ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_Ingredients: singular term vs story/board 'Ingredients'" .
:Con_Step dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_MealPreparationStep ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_MealPreparationStep: containment; story C work object" .
:Con_Substitute dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_IngredientsSubstitutes ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_IngredientsSubstitutes: containment; story B work object" .
:Con_HelpMealPlan dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_MealPlan ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_MealPlan: containment; board business object 'Meal plan'" .
:Con_MenuProposal dkg:proposedSameAs :Cap_AIProposals ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Cap_AIProposals: glossary term vs core capability 'Proposals based on larder, etc.' (cross-class)" .
:Con_Course dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_Meal ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_Meal: glossary v2 'Course contains Meal 1..*' — not the same; listed so the room sees Course has no counterpart anywhere else" .

# --- Questions: new, and effect on existing ones (none closed) ---
:Q_GlossaryMarkers a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "What do blue, green, grey and the ⊞ marker mean on glossary v2?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Blue+⊞ (Dinner, Menu, Course), green+⊞ (Help provider, Chef, Help Meal plan, Menu proposal), grey (Meal). Ingredient, Step and Substitute are new but plain yellow, so ⊞ is not simply 'new'. No legend." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Glossary_2026_10_v2 ; dkg:locator "whole glossary" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_Glossary_2026_10_v2 dkg:raises :Q_GlossaryMarkers .
:Q_ChefNotInGlossary rdfs:comment "Glossary v2 adds Chef (is Help provider, provides Help 0..*), Dinner, Menu and a 'Help Meal plan' kind of Help Request — story A's planning help now has terms. Not closed: Help Request is still 'at' Community or Grandma Avatar only, not at Chef." .
:Q_HelpRequestAtWhom rdfs:comment "Glossary v2 introduces Help provider as a supertype of Community, Grandma Avatar and Chef, but still draws 'at 1 Community' and 'at 1 Grandma Avatar' rather than 'at Help provider'." .
:Q_PicturesTwoSenses rdfs:comment "Glossary v2 bounds Picture at 0..10 on Help Request, Help and Thanks; still one Picture term." .

:Q_HelpMandatoryContents a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Must every Help contain substitutes, an explanation, mitigation steps and menu proposals at once?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Glossary v2 raises the minimums on all four 'Help contains' arrows (1..3, 1, 1..10, 1..3), while Help Request is split into four kinds (catastrophe, preparation step, ingredients, meal plan) that each seem to need only one of them." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Glossary_2026_10_v2 ; dkg:locator "Help 'contains' arrows" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_Glossary_2026_10_v2 dkg:raises :Q_HelpMandatoryContents .

