:Art_ContextMap_2026_10 a dkg:Artifact ;
    rdfs:label "Larder context map (attached image)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Context map (dkg has no subclass for it). 10 contexts, 14 arrows. Legend: dashed = asynchronous, solid = synchronous; whether arrows show call or data direction is not stated. Pattern boxes: OHS ×9, ACL ×1 (Grandma Avatar AI), CF ×1 (Sharing). Payload stickies beside arrows; pairs of opposite arrows (Meal Planning↔Cooking Assistance, Cooking Assistance↔Meal Preparation) share one set of stickies — pairing read by position." ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-10-10"^^xsd:date .

