# --- Effect on existing questions, and new questions ---
:Ctx_CookingAssistance rdfs:comment "Context map keeps 'Cooking Assistance' and draws no 'Cooking Help' context." .
:Q_RecipeSearchCapability rdfs:comment "Context map gives recipes their own context, Recipe Catalog (OHS); the capability map still has none." .
:Q_ArrowDirection a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Do the context map's arrows show who calls whom, or which way data flows?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Legend gives only sync/async. OHS boxes sit at the tail on some arrows (Recipe Catalog, Cook Profile) and at the head on others (Notification, Meal Preparation, Sharing, Cooking Assistance from Media), so upstream/downstream cannot be read off reliably." ;
    dkg:source :Art_ContextMap_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "legend; all arrows" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_ContextMap_2026_10 dkg:raises :Q_ArrowDirection .
:Q_ConsentNotification a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Where do Consent and Notification come from?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Consent Management and Notification appear first on the context map; no story, board event, glossary term or capability mentions consent or notifications." ;
    dkg:source :Art_ContextMap_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "Consent Management, Notification" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_ContextMap_2026_10 dkg:raises :Q_ConsentNotification .
:Q_MissingPrepEvents a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Where did Step competeted, Meal rescued and Meal prepared go?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Board events 17-19 (Meal Preparation, second drawing) are on no context of the map." ;
    dkg:source :Art_ContextMap_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "Meal Preparation context" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_ContextMap_2026_10 dkg:raises :Q_MissingPrepEvents .
:Q_SharingConformist a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Why is Sharing a conformist only to Consent Management?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Sharing has OHS towards Media and Meal Preparation and CF towards Consent Management — the only CF on the map." ;
    dkg:source :Art_ContextMap_2026_10 ; dkg:locator "Sharing context, bottom" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_ContextMap_2026_10 dkg:raises :Q_SharingConformist .
:Q_RevenueNoActivity rdfs:comment "Context map: no membership, payment, paywall or ads context." .


