# Ingest — EventStorming board v2, REVISION of :Art_ESBoard_2026_10 (two photos, stitched),
# 2026-10-10. Revise. Overlap vs v1: share 96%, cover 82% → revision.
# Renames applied above (IRI kept, old label → altLabel): Ctx_CookingAssistance
# ('Cook Assistance'), Ctx_Sharing ('Thanks'), Con_RecipeCatalog ('Recipes').
# All dkg:precedes between Ev_ nodes come from this revision: v2 is laid out
# as one left-to-right timeline of lanes; v1 was not.
##############################################################################
:Art_ESBoard_2026_10_v2 a dkg:EventStormingBoard ;
    rdfs:label "Larder EventStorming board v2 (two photos)" ;
    dkg:revisionOf :Art_ESBoard_2026_10 ;
    rdfs:comment "Same 21 event stickies in one left-to-right timeline of 10 lanes. Added: 14 purple state stickies (12 distinct). Renamed: Cooking Assistance and both Cooking Help bubbles → 'Cook Assistance'; Sharing → 'Thanks'; read model Recipe Catalog → 'Recipes'. Removed: robot icons. Unattached: a text-less event icon plus floating Recipe, Help Response (read models) and Ingredients (business object) at the bottom of the first Meal Planning lane. Still no hotspots, aggregates or policies. No Decision in the graph asked for this revision." ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-10-10"^^xsd:date .

