# --- Renamed (sources + notes) ---
:Ctx_CookingAssistance dkg:source :Art_ESBoard_2026_10_v2 ;
    rdfs:comment "Board v2 names this lane 'Cook Assistance' — and gives the same name to the two lanes v1 called 'Cooking Help'. The context map (same day) still says 'Cooking Assistance'." .
:Ctx_Sharing dkg:source :Art_ESBoard_2026_10_v2 ;
    rdfs:comment "Board v2 names this lane 'Thanks'; the context map still says 'Sharing'. 'Thanks' is now both a context name and a business object / glossary term." .
:Con_RecipeCatalog dkg:source :Art_ESBoard_2026_10_v2 ;
    rdfs:comment "Board v2 renames the read model of 'Recipes searched' from 'Recipe Catalog' to 'Recipes'; the context map made 'Recipe Catalog' a context." .
[] a dkg:spelling ; dkg:literal "Cook Assistance" ; dkg:spelledOn :Art_ESBoard_2026_10_v2 ;
   rdfs:comment "board v1 and context map: 'Cooking Assistance'; board v1 also 'Cooking Help'" .

# --- Removed ---
:Ctx_CookingHelp dkg:absentFrom :Art_ESBoard_2026_10_v2 ;
    rdfs:comment "Board v2 has no 'Cooking Help' lane; both positions are now labelled 'Cook Assistance'. Evidence for, not a decision on, the pending proposal Cooking Assistance ~ Cooking Help." .
:Q_RobotIcon rdfs:comment "Board v2 removes the robot icon from both events." ; dkg:source :Art_ESBoard_2026_10_v2 .

