# --- proposals ---
:Con_Status_Cook dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_Status ;
    rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_Status: same word; Cook status (active/inActive/premium) vs Help Request status (Open/Answered) — listed so the room can confirm they stay apart" .
:Con_CookId dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_Requester ;
    rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_Requester: identical example UUID f64e07f0-… on the Cook and Help Request models" .
:Con_CookId dkg:proposedSameAs :Con_Subject ;
    rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs Con_Subject: identical example UUID f64e07f0-… on the Cook and Consent models" .
:Con_Premium_CookStatus dkg:proposedSameAs :Imp_ConvertToPaidPlan ;
    rdfs:comment "weak, cross-class: Cook status 'premium' is the first domain-model trace of the paid plan the impact map v3 names; not the same thing — a state the conversion would reach" .
:Con_MemberSince dkg:proposedSameAs :Cap_MemberManagement ;
    rdfs:comment "weak, cross-class: 'memberSince' is the first domain-model attribute about membership; Member management is a generic capability" .

# --- questions ---
:Q_NameGivenName a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Are the name / givenName examples swapped?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Example name 'Joe', givenName 'Doe' — 'given name' usually means the first name." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Glossary_Cook ; dkg:locator "examples beside name and givenName" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_Glossary_Cook dkg:raises :Q_NameGivenName .
:Q_PremiumVsPaying a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Is a 'premium' cook the 'paying member' the goal counts?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Goal (impact map v3): min. 2,500 paying members. Canvas revenue: Monthly member fee. Cook model: status premium, memberSince. No artifact connects them; no context owns payment." ;
    dkg:source :Art_Glossary_Cook ; dkg:locator "status value 'premium'" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Implied .
:Art_Glossary_Cook dkg:raises :Q_PremiumVsPaying .
:Q_RevenueNoActivity rdfs:comment "Cook model: status 'premium' and 'memberSince' are the first domain-level traces of membership; still no payment, paywall or ads anywhere below the strategy artifacts." ; dkg:source :Art_Glossary_Cook .
:Q_CooksRole rdfs:comment "Cook model: one Cook aggregate, with memberSince and status active/inActive/premium — a member, not a partner or a resource." ; dkg:source :Art_Glossary_Cook .

