    dkg:source :Art_APC_GrandmaAvatar ; dkg:locator "Events Send / Payload" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .

# --- the two ends of one border name the outgoing event differently ---
:Ev_HelpRequestCreated rdfs:comment "Producer/consumer mismatch: Cooking Assistance canvas SENDS 'Help request created'; Grandma Avatar canvas RECEIVES 'Help requested' (context map v2 also says 'Help requested'). Proposal Help request created ~ Help requested still pending." .
:Q_HelpEventName a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Which name does the event on the Cooking Assistance → Grandma Avatar border carry: 'Help request created' or 'Help requested'?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Sender's canvas: 'Help request created'. Receiver's canvas, context map v2 and boards: 'Help requested'. On an async border the name is the contract." ;
    dkg:source :Art_APC_GrandmaAvatar, :Art_APC_CookingAssistance ; dkg:locator "Events Send (Cooking Assistance) / Events Receive (Grandma Avatar)" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_APC_GrandmaAvatar dkg:raises :Q_HelpEventName .
:Q_HelpResponseOrHelp a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Is the answer called 'Help' or 'Help response'?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Grandma Avatar canvas: payload 'Help', note says 'help response look like in Cook Assistance'. Cooking Assistance canvases and models: 'help' / 'Help'. Board, context maps: 'Help response'. Glossaries: 'Help'. Proposal Help response ~ Help is still pending." ;
    dkg:source :Art_APC_GrandmaAvatar ; dkg:locator "Notes; Payload" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_APC_GrandmaAvatar dkg:raises :Q_HelpResponseOrHelp .
:Q_CredentialOnCanvases a dkg:Question ;
    skos:prefLabel "Remove the production credential from the async canvases?" ;
    rdfs:comment "The Server field of the Cooking Assistance (async) and Grandma Avatar canvases shows the same amqps user and password. Not copied into this graph." ;
    dkg:source :Art_APC_GrandmaAvatar, :Art_APC_CookingAssistance ; dkg:locator "Server field" ; dkg:confidence dkg:OnArtifact .
:Art_APC_GrandmaAvatar dkg:raises :Q_CredentialOnCanvases .

