    rdfs:comment "API Product Canvas (Junker & Lazzaretti), synchronous side. Server https://larder.org/notifications. 'e.g. http' / 'e.g. RESTful oriented' read as template text. 3 paths, 4 operations, no invariants. DELETE lists no 404; PUT …/status lists no notificationId parameter." ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-10-10"^^xsd:date .
:Ctx_Notification dkg:source :Art_APC_Notifications_Sync ; rdfs:comment "Sync API Product Canvas: REST API at https://larder.org/notifications." .
:VP_ProvidingOfNotificationsToCooks a dkg:ValueProposition ; skos:prefLabel "Providing of notifications to Cooks" ;
