:Art_API_MealPreparation_OAS a dkg:Artifact ;
    rdfs:label "Meal Preparation API — OpenAPI 3.1, version 1.0.0 (meal-preparation.openapi.yaml)" ;
    rdfs:comment "OpenAPI draft from the Meal Preparation canvas and Meal preparation model. recipe is a UUID reference; currentStep holds only howToStepId and sequenceNumber ('instruction text and other step content are undefined'). Canvas stepId on next/previous modelled as a query precondition; stale step → 400 CURRENT_STEP_MISMATCH, bounds → LAST/FIRST_STEP_REACHED; creation starts at the first step; recipe without steps rejected. Recipe example e1e82a2e-… — the Thanks model's thanks Id / giver example." ;
    dkg:mentions :Ctx_MealPreparation ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-10-10"^^xsd:date .
:R_API_PrepStartsAtFirstStep a dkg:Rule ; skos:prefLabel "A new preparation starts at the recipe's first step; a recipe without steps cannot be prepared" ; rdfs:comment "contract lifecycle proposal" ;
    dkg:inContext :Ctx_MealPreparation ; dkg:mentions :Con_MealPreparation_Agg, :Con_HowToStepId ; dkg:source :Art_API_MealPreparation_OAS ; dkg:locator "POST /preparations" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Q_MealPrepStates rdfs:comment "Meal Preparation OpenAPI proposes navigation semantics (expected-current-step precondition, first/last bounds) but no states or completion." ; dkg:source :Art_API_MealPreparation_OAS .
:Q_ExampleUUIDsReused rdfs:comment "Meal Preparation OpenAPI: recipe example e1e82a2e-… is the Thanks model's thanks Id and giver example; preparationId example is the recipe Id example 7cf09822-…." ; dkg:source :Art_API_MealPreparation_OAS .
:Q_MissingPrepEvents rdfs:comment "Meal Preparation OpenAPI says step content is undefined; the Recipe model (ingested later) gives howto Step a description and an optional illustration." ; dkg:source :Art_API_MealPreparation_OAS .

