# Ingest — API contract 'Recipe Catalog API 1.0.0 (OpenAPI 3.1)' (recipe-catalog.openapi.yaml), 2026-10-10. Grow.
# DERIVED DOCUMENT: generated from canvas + model; everything new is dkg:Inferred,
# sourced to the contract. Existing nodes are NOT re-sourced (no false corroboration).
##############################################################################
:Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS a dkg:Artifact ;
    rdfs:label "Recipe Catalog API — OpenAPI 3.1, version 1.0.0 (recipe-catalog.openapi.yaml)" ;
    rdfs:comment "OpenAPI draft from the Recipe Catalog canvas and Recipe model. OAuth2 recipes:read/write, external-public. Diet enum VEGETARIAN/VEGAN/NORMAL; Meal BREAKFAST…SUPPER; Unit 13 values. Preparation time read as HH:MM. Search: exact meal/diet, ingredient names case-insensitive, all must match. Owner rule extended to nested POSTs (inferred). Last ingredient / last step cannot be deleted. 404 added to DELETE recipe (canvas omits it). 'Download recipe' = GET full JSON. Unit description claims the glossary spells 'Kilogramm and Gramm' and an assumption says 'Gramm is preserved as GRAMM' — the enum says KILOGRAM/GRAM and the Recipe model image reads Kilogram/Gram." ;
    dkg:mentions :Ctx_RecipeCatalog ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-10-10"^^xsd:date .
:R_API_OwnerOnlyNestedCreate a dkg:Rule ; skos:prefLabel "Only the recipe owner may add ingredients and how-to steps" ; rdfs:comment "contract extends the canvas's 'Only owner can change/delete' to the nested POSTs, which carry no purple sticky" ;
    dkg:inContext :Ctx_RecipeCatalog ; dkg:mentions :R_RC_OnlyOwnerCanChange ; dkg:source :Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS ; dkg:locator "POST …/ingredients, POST …/how-to-steps" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:R_API_OwnerOnlyNestedCreate dkg:proposedSameAs :R_RC_OnlyOwnerCanChange ; rdfs:comment "proposedSameAs R_RC_OnlyOwnerCanChange: same ownership policy, applied to rows the canvas left unmarked" .
:Q_UnitSpelling a dkg:Question ; skos:prefLabel "Which spelling of the gram units is meant — Gram/Kilogram or Gramm/Kilogramm?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Recipe model: Kilogram, Gram (checked against the image). Recipe Catalog contract: claims 'Kilogramm and Gramm' / 'GRAMM' in prose, enum KILOGRAM/GRAM. Cooking Assistance contract: the Help model's 'Gramm' normalised to GRAM." ; dkg:mentions :Con_Unit, :Con_Gram_Unit, :Con_Kilogram_Unit ;
    dkg:source :Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS ; dkg:locator "schemas.Unit description; x-design-assumptions" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS dkg:raises :Q_UnitSpelling .
:Q_PreparationTimeUnit a dkg:Question ; skos:prefLabel "Is preparation time hours:minutes?" ;
    rdfs:comment "Recipe model example '02:00'; contract reads two hours, pending confirmation." ; dkg:mentions :Con_PreparationTime ;
    dkg:source :Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS ; dkg:locator "schemas.PreparationTime" ; dkg:confidence dkg:Inferred .
:Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS dkg:raises :Q_PreparationTimeUnit .
:Q_RecipePatchRecipient rdfs:comment "Recipe Catalog OpenAPI treats 'changed recipient' as a typo for the singular resource (proposal)." ; dkg:source :Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS .
:Q_RecipeImagesNoOperation rdfs:comment "Recipe Catalog OpenAPI: mainImage and furtherImages are set by POST/PATCH of the recipe as URLs; no image sub-resource." ; dkg:source :Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS .
:Cap_DownloadRecipe rdfs:comment "Recipe Catalog OpenAPI implements 'Download recipe' as GET /recipes/{recipeId} (full JSON); no export operation." ; dkg:source :Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS .
:Q_ExampleUUIDsReused rdfs:comment "Recipe-catalog consumers: Media contract's link example https://larder.org/recipe-catalog/recipes/7cf09822-… treats the recipe Id example as a real recipe reference — consistent with the Help Request model." ; dkg:source :Art_API_RecipeCatalog_OAS .

