:Q_HelpProvidedConsumers rdfs:comment "Context map v3 still draws Sharing ← Meal Preparation and the new Sharing ← Cooking Assistance as synchronous GETs, not events." ; dkg:source :Art_ContextMap_2026_10_v3 .

