:Q_HelpRequestStateNames rdfs:comment "Help Request model v2: Open / Answered / Closed. The Cooking Assistance contracts (OPEN / ANSWERED, derived from v1) have no CLOSED and still say 'must answer' instead of 'must be accepted'." ; dkg:source :Art_Glossary_HelpRequest_v2 .
:Q_HRClosedTransition a dkg:Question ; skos:prefLabel "When does a Help Request become Closed?" ; rdfs:comment "v2 adds Closed and says answered requests can still be answered — so answering does not end a request. No artifact names what closes it (accepting a Help? the requester?)." ; dkg:mentions :Con_Closed_HRStatus, :R_HR2_AnsweredCanStillBeAnswered, :Con_IsAccepted ;
