:Ex_EM01_R1_E1 a :Example ; skos:prefLabel "Lena asks Marco for a Menu for \"Mother-in-law visiting\", Sat 19:00, 4 guests, vegetarian, 60 € → Marco gets the Occasion, no courses" ; :illustrates :R_EM01_R1 ;
